.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt WFLINFO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wflinfo
.Nd print the OpenGL or OpenGL ES context a platform makes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl p Ar platform
.Fl a Ar api
.Op Fl V Ar version
.Op Fl Fl profile Ar profile
.Op Fl v
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
makes a context of
.Ar api ,
.Ql gl ,
.Ql gles1 ,
.Ql gles2
or
.Ql gles3 ,
through Waffle on
.Ar platform ,
such as
.Ql gbm
or
.Ql surfaceless_egl ,
and prints its vendor, renderer and version strings, and with
.Fl v
its extensions.
.Pp
.Dl wflinfo -p gbm -a gl
.Pp
Piglit runs it to learn the versions and extensions a driver offers, and
skips a test whose requirements it cannot read.
The desktop layer supplies it from Debian's
.Sy waffle-utils .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr eglinfo 1 ,
.Xr piglit 1
